A.lSr=new B.aw(["as long as; all you need is","noun + \u3055\u3048 + \u3070-form \xb7 \u6642\u9593\u3055\u3048\u3042\u308c\u3070","It means that one thing is all you need.","As long as I have time, I want to go on a trip.","as long as"])
