A.fXx=new B.aB([2,"My whole family enjoyed the trip, starting with my father.",3,"The people at the company, including the president, gathered.",4,"I like all kinds of instruments, starting with the piano.",5,"Our classmates came, including Yamada-san."],t.g)
A.fY9=new B.aB([2,"I'm less busy this month than last month.",3,"I'm shorter than my older brother.",4,"Nights are longer in winter than in summer.",5,"My town is quiet compared to Tokyo."],t.g)
A.fXb=new B.aB([2,"I've been feeling a bit tense about work lately.",3,"I'm a bit short on sleep this morning, so my head hurts.",4,"I've put on a little weight lately, so I started taking walks.",5,"It's right before the exam, so everyone's a little nervous."],t.g)
A.fY_=new B.aB([2,"Trains tend to run late on rainy days.",3,"When I'm busy, I tend to forget to eat lunch.",4,"Kids tend to get sick.",5,"In summer, I tend to drink a lot of cold drinks."],t.g)
A.fYW=new B.aB([2,"If you don't take your medicine, you could end up getting sicker.",3,"If you play games until late at night, you could end up unable to get up in the morning.",4,"If you don't take an umbrella, you could get soaked and catch a cold.",5,"If you drive when you're tired, you could end up causing an accident."],t.g)
A.fWT=new B.aB([2,"It's raining today, and on top of that, it's windy.",3,"He's smart, and on top of that, he's kind.",4,"I overslept this morning, and on top of that, the train was late.",5,"This apartment is far from the station, and on top of that, the rent is high."],t.g)
A.fYS=new B.aB([2,"He made it himself, but he says it isn't good.",3,"My little brother hasn't done his homework, but he's just playing games.",4,"My friend has time, but won't help me.",5,"My older sister was late herself, but she got mad at me."],t.g)
A.fYR=new B.aB([2,"My little brother had barely woken up, and now he's already playing.",3,"The train came, and then it left right away.",4,"The sky got bright, and then it got dark right away.",5,"The kid was just crying, and now he's already laughing."],t.g)
A.fWD=new B.aB([2,"As long as the weather's nice, I want to eat in the park.",3,"As long as I have friends, I'm not lonely.",4,"If you just buy a ticket, you can get on the train.",5,"Flowers grow up healthy as long as they have water."],t.g)
A.fYF=new B.aB([2,"If I could go, I'd want to go to the sea right now.",3,"If I could, I'd love to see my faraway friend once more.",4,"If I could rest, I'd want to sleep all day tomorrow.",5,"If I could, I'd want to eat sushi every day."],t.g)
A.fWz=new B.aB([2,"I can't wait for summer vacation.",3,"I skipped breakfast, so I'm starving.",4,"I walked all day yesterday, so my feet are killing me.",5,"I can't stop wondering about my interview results."],t.g)
A.fY6=new B.aB([2,"It's so hot today that I can't stand it.",3,"I can't stop worrying about my child's exam results.",4,"This new game is so much fun.",5,"I walked all the way to the station, so my feet really hurt."],t.g)
A.fYT=new B.aB([2,"Only after I came to Japan did I realize how hard it is to live alone.",3,"Only after I talked to a friend did I feel lighter.",4,"Only after I made it myself did I appreciate my mom's cooking.",5,"Only when I got to the station did I notice I'd forgotten my wallet."],t.g)
A.fXN=new B.aB([2,"Now that you're a student, you have to study every day.",3,"Now that I've started this job, I'll give it my all until the end.",4,"Since I said I'd do it, I'll see it through to the end.",5,"Now that I've bought a new bag, I'll take good care of it."],t.g)
A.fYU=new B.aB([2,"I'll apply after I read the explanation.",3,"I'd like to decide the travel date after I ask my teacher.",4,"I'll buy a new computer after I check the prices.",5,"I'll pick where to go after checking the weather forecast."],t.g)
A.fWp=new B.aB([2,"Maybe because I walked a lot over the weekend, my legs hurt a little.",3,"Maybe it's the heat, but I can't eat much.",4,"Maybe because I'm tired, I've been sleepy since this morning.",5,"Maybe it's the rain, but there aren't many people at the station."],t.g)
A.fX6=new B.aB([2,"As long as I'm in Japan, I want to speak Japanese every day.",3,"As long as I have time, I want to read books.",4,"As far as I know, this shop is always crowded.",5,"As long as my mom's healthy, I'll visit her every week."],t.g)
A.fZ5=new B.aB([2,"The sky is dark, so it must be about to rain.",3,"That place always has a lot of people, so the food must be good.",4,"The lights are on, so my mom must already be home.",5,"Mr. Tanaka practices every day, so he must be good."],t.g)
A.fXH=new B.aB([2,"My mom made it, so I can't leave any.",3,"It's raining, so I can't go out without an umbrella.",4,"Even with a fever, I can't leave my kid alone.",5,"My exam is coming up, so I can't just play around."],t.g)
A.fYL=new B.aB([2,"The train stopped, so I have no choice but to walk home.",3,"I have a high fever, so I have no choice but to take a day off work.",4,"The rain won't let up, so I have no choice but to give up on going out.",5,"I forgot my wallet, so I have no choice but to borrow money from a friend."],t.g)
A.fYC=new B.aB([2,"Not all Japanese people like sushi.",3,"Even if the forecast says sunny, it won't necessarily be sunny all day.",4,"Even if I get up early, I don't always get a seat on the train.",5,"Even if I study every day, I won't necessarily get good right away."],t.g)
A.fWJ=new B.aB([2,"I'm still just a student.",3,"That's just a small mistake.",4,"His story is nothing more than a joke.",5,"This is only a small part of it."],t.g)
A.fWO=new B.aB([2,"I'm so busy at work that my fatigue just keeps piling up.",3,"The amount of trash just keeps growing lately.",4,"Now that it's fall, the nights just keep getting colder.",5,"Since I started living alone, my money just keeps dwindling."],t.g)
A.fWV=new B.aB([2,"Now that it's spring, it's gradually getting warmer.",3,"My Japanese is slowly getting better.",4,"More new shops are opening in front of the station.",5,"My little brother's cold is getting better."],t.g)
A.fZ7=new B.aB([2,"I heard Mr. Tanaka is going to Kyoto next week.",3,"I heard a new bakery is opening in front of the station.",4,"I heard Mr. Yamada is quitting the company next month.",5,"I heard it's going to be really hot this summer."],t.g)
A.fYi=new B.aB([2,"I saw a delicious-looking cake and couldn't help eating it.",3,"It was a sad movie, so I couldn't help crying.",4,"Whenever I see new shoes, I can't help buying them.",5,"Even when I'm busy, I can't help writing in my diary every day."],t.g)
A.fY8=new B.aB([2,"Here's the menu.",3,"This one is 3,000 yen.",4,"The meeting room is on the second floor.",5,"Your bill comes to 500 yen."],t.g)
